sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as You
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as API
    participant D as Database

    U->>W: Enter username and password
    W->>A: GET /api/v1/csrf
    A-->>W: CSRF token, kept in your session
    W->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/login + X-CSRF-TOKEN
    Note over A: Validate the request,<br/>then check the IP throttle
    alt IP throttled
        A-->>W: 429 + Retry-After
        W-->>U: "Unable to connect to the server"
    else IP allowed
        A->>D: Load account, verify BCrypt hash
        alt Correct, account enabled and unlocked
            A->>D: Reset the failure count
            A-->>W: 200 + rotated SESSION cookie
            W-->>U: Redirect to /, "Hello, johndoe"
        else Wrong, unknown, locked or disabled
            A->>D: Count the failure (enabled, unlocked only)
            A-->>W: 401 "Invalid username or password"
            W-->>U: Same generic banner
        end
    end
